{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261110/photo/bkn-20261110154457882-1110_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261110180914\"/><p>事主送院治理。（陳嘉傑攝）</p><p>今午(10日)2時38分，一名姓許(63歲)男工人在西灣河太康街1號地下進行外牆裝修工程期間，意外被其手持的磨機割傷濺血，需要在場工友協助報案。救護員奉召到場，發現事主的左手掌留下約10厘米長的傷痕，大腿亦告受傷，為他進行初步敷治後，再送往東區醫院治理。事故原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.051441+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T07:44:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T14:35:23.250342+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:59.922459+00:00","content_hash":"51a195a3a2b39b95aeea030a2240fcdeae5de9f7c5d7996f3645c4fdca359510","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}